<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ProMedCo buy rated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ProMedCo buy rated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co said analyst Tom Hodapp initiated coverage of ProMedCo Management Co with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Robertson, Stephens was a manager of the company's March initial public offering, along with Piper Jaffray and Cowen &amp; Co, which initiated coverage of the stock on Monday with strong buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- The share rose 1/8 at 9-1/4.</p>
</text>
